#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3066
msgid "Available translations can be installed with one click, and missing ones can be requested. While automatic installs are on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync."
msgstr "As traduzions disponibles se pueden instalar con un clic y as que faltan se pueden solicitar. Entre que as instalaciones automáticas son activadas, as traduzions que o servicio indica como disponibles pa las luengas que administras s'instalan durante a sincronización dos begadas a o día."

